+
+# ============================================================
+# TIER 3 — NEVER track (explicit non-LFS) — normal git
+# ============================================================
+*.go     text diff=golang
+*.json   text
+*.md     text
+*.yaml   text diff=yaml
+*.yml    text diff=yaml
+*.sh     text eol=lf
+Makefile text
+Dockerfile text
+
+# Lockfiles
+go.sum   text
+
+# Coverage output — generated, not LFS
+coverage.out text
